{
  "_comment": "Generated from data/case_tables dialogue CSV.",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "你……你是同船的？我叫阿贵，跟了老爷十二年。这次是去武昌府进棉布。",
      "emotion": "nervous",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "你是做什么的？",
          "goto": "ask_master",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "这次夜船是谁安排的？",
          "goto": "ask_voyage",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "你跟老爷关系好吗？",
          "goto": "ask_feelings",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "墙边那件湿斗篷是谁碰过？",
          "goto": "ask_wet_cloak",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_wet_cloak_checked"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "看看船舱里有什么",
          "goto": "observe_cabin",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_master": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "小的叫阿贵，跟了老爷十二年。老爷是做布匹生意的，这次是去武昌府进一批棉布。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "老爷对小的有知遇之恩。十六岁进的门，什么都不会——是老爷手把手教的。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年了……不短。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_voyage": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "这次夜船是老爷安排的。说是急着赶路，要赶武昌的早市。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "小的不敢多嘴。老爷说什么就是什么。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "夜船危险，他不敢多嘴？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_feelings": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "老爷……老爷对小的严厉，但也是为小的好。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年了……小的半条命都是老爷给的。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "crying"
        },
        {
          "text": "他低下头，手指无意识地搓着衣角",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "严厉……但也是为你好。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_wet_cloak": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked",
        "cabin_agui_cloak_pressed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "我舱里那件斗篷又湿了一层。船上有人进过我的舱？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "小的不知道。小的一直在老爷那边伺候。外头雨这么大，许是风从门缝灌进去的。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "他答得太快，手指却把衣角搓得更紧。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "若真有人进去过，小的也没瞧见。船舱这么窄，雨声又重，谁能听得清？",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous",
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "阿贵证言：湿斗篷",
          "record_text": "阿贵称自己没有碰过陆昭舱内湿斗篷，也不知道谁进过陆昭舱室。",
          "record_id": "record_cabin_agui_wet_cloak"
        },
        {
          "text": "听不清，不等于没人进去过。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "observe_cabin": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_observed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "船舱不大，但收拾得还算干净。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "舱壁上挂着一根铁撬棍，旁边是蓑衣和斗笠。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "角落有几只木箱，用麻绳捆着。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "铁撬棍的位置有点奇怪——挂在舱壁正中间，像是特意放在那里的。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "这铁撬棍放得倒显眼……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
